{
  "A text field of several lines: a box that grows with the text or that the user drags bigger, a character counter, a clear button, Ctrl+Enter to send, and the label, help text and validation every field has.": "",
  "Every prop takes a value or a function; `x-model` binds the text two-way. Created with `new`, the same properties are set programmatically.": "",
  "Growing with the text": "",
  "With `autoGrow` the box follows the text: never smaller than `minRows` lines, never taller than `maxRows`; past that it scrolls. A narrower box wraps into more lines and grows too.": "",
  "Resize": "",
  "The grip at the corner of the box lets the user drag it taller (`vertical`, the default), in both directions (`both`), or not at all (`none`).": "",
  "Counter and limits": "",
  "`maxLength` stops typing at the limit, `minLength` is checked when the field is left; `showCounter` shows the count under the box.": "",
  "Ctrl+Enter": "",
  "Enter starts a new line. Ctrl+Enter (Cmd+Enter on a Mac) fires `onEnter` with the value: the usual way to send a message or save a note.": "",
  "Read-only, disabled, required": "",
  "A new line.": "",
  "Commits the value (with `updateOn=\"change\"`) and fires `onEnter`: send, save.": "",
  "Leaves the field; the clear button is not a Tab stop (Escape does its job).": "",
  "A native `<textarea>` (multi-line by nature); its `<label>` is tied to it with `for`.": "",
  "Say it in the label or the help text when it sends something, as in the example above.": "",
  "The name of the clear button and the validation messages come from `uiLocale.strings`.": "",
  "TextArea uses the field tokens (`field.*`, see TextBox) and has none of its own: the first line lines up with a one-line field of the same size.": "",
  "The field. `data-resize`, `data-auto-grow`, and the field attributes (`data-size`, `data-variant`, `data-label-mode`, `data-invalid`, `data-readonly`, `data-disabled`, `data-filled`).": "",
  "The box; it carries the resize grip.": "",
  "The textarea.": "",
  "The clear button.": "",
  "The text, lines separated by `\\n`. `x-model` binds it two-way.": "",
  "Visible lines.": "",
  "The box follows the text, from `minRows` to `maxRows` lines, then scrolls.": "",
  "The smallest box with `autoGrow`.": "",
  "The largest box with `autoGrow`; without it the box grows without a limit.": "",
  "`none`, `vertical`, `both`: which way the user can drag the box. `none` while `autoGrow` is on.": "",
  "Limits; both are checked by validation.": "",
  "`12/500` under the box (`12` without `maxLength`).": "",
  "`change`: the value changes when the field is left or Ctrl+Enter is pressed.": "",
  "`off` keeps long lines on one line and scrolls sideways.": "",
  "Passed to the `<textarea>`.": "",
  "The native `<textarea>`.": "",
  "Focuses the textarea.": "",
  "Ctrl+Enter (Cmd+Enter) was pressed. `e`: `{ value, source, event }`.": "",
  "The DOM events of the textarea reach the field.": ""
}
